<section id="inspirations" class="container py-10">
  <h2 class="section__title">Inspirations</h2>
  <p class="section__description">
    Everything I think or have in my mind, is influenced by incredible people, Their dreams come true, they give me the power to never give up and keep pushing.
  </p>

  <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-[16px] border-2 border-accent-blue bg-bg-surface p-4">
      <figure class="flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-accent-blue">
        <img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/img/inspiration/mududev.jpg" alt="Miguel Ángel Durán" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Miguel Ángel Durán</p>
        <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-red">The best streamer dev ever</h5>
        <blockquote class="text-base italic text-text-secondary">
          “Don't compare yourself... You have just started, and you have many things ahead of you to learn and assimilate”
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-[16px] border-2 border-accent-blue bg-bg-surface p-4 lg:flex-row-reverse">
      <figure class="flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-accent-blue">
        <img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/img/inspiration/pamela-valdes.png" alt="Pamela Valdés" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Pamela Valdés</p>
        <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-red">CEO & Cofounder of Beek</h5>
        <blockquote class="text-base italic text-text-secondary">
          “If you are not willing to lose everything, you are not willing to win it”
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-[16px] border-2 border-accent-blue bg-bg-surface p-4">
      <figure class="flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-accent-blue">
        <img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/img/inspiration/tatiana-calderon.png" alt="Tatiana Calderón" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Tatiana Calderón</p>
        <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-red">Super Formula & WEC LMP2 driver</h5>
        <blockquote class="text-base italic text-text-secondary">
          “The only person who can determine what your limits are is you”
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-[16px] border-2 border-accent-blue bg-bg-surface p-4 lg:flex-row-reverse">
      <figure class="flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-accent-blue">
        <img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/img/inspiration/robbie.png" alt="Robbie J. Frye" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Robbie J. Frye</p>
        <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-red">Host of The Frye Show podcast</h5>
        <blockquote class="text-base italic text-text-secondary">
          “You can earn more money, not more time”
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-[16px] border-2 border-accent-blue bg-bg-surface p-4">
      <figure class="flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-accent-blue">
        <img class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="/img/inspiration/lewis-hamilton-turkey.png" alt="Lewis Hamilton on Turkey" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Lewis Hamilton</p>
        <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent-red">F1 World champion</h5>
        <blockquote class="text-base italic text-text-secondary">
          “You can do anything you put your mind to!”
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
